I feel that artifacts should be alive. Especially mega weapons like
Stormbringer and Excalibur should have a will and try to force it
on their wielder. If you remain true to their legends Stormbringer
should be a evil weapon, thirsty for souls. When it hasn't killed for
a while it should refuse to leave your hands (like a cursed weapon) until
it has killed. If that does not occur soon enough it should attack its
owner. Likewise Excalibur should refuse to attack peaceful monsters and
resist when used by non lawful characters.

This would make artifacts much more interesting. Rather than just very
good weapons they would be a complex game element; very powerful IF you
can live with the disadvantages that come with it. Deciding which is
your favoured weapon becomes more complex and more dependent on your
playing style.
